%% Status: CURRENT — FRONTEND (derived client-side; nothing delivered/pushed)
%% Source: frontend/src/lib/notifications.ts, frontend/src/components/app/NotificationCenter.tsx
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Bell as NotificationCenter.tsx
    participant AppData as AppDataProvider (events, dismissed/read state)
    participant Lib as lib/notifications.ts (buildNotifications)

    Bell->>AppData: read events, dismissedNotifications, readNotifications
    Bell->>Lib: buildNotifications(events, dismissedNotifications)
    Lib->>Lib: occurrencesInRange(events, today-14d, today+30d)
    Lib->>Lib: for each occurrence: compute section (Today/Upcoming/Earlier),<br/>relative-day label, summary, timestamp
    Lib->>Lib: filter out dismissed keys; sort by section then date/time
    Lib-->>Bell: EventNotification[]
    Bell->>Bell: unread = notifications not in readNotifications
    Bell-->>User: bell icon with unread count badge; popover list grouped by section

    alt user opens a notification
        User->>Bell: click a notification
        Bell->>AppData: markNotificationRead(key)
        Bell->>Bell: open EventDetailDialog for the underlying occurrence
    else user marks all read
        User->>Bell: "Mark all read"
        Bell->>AppData: markAllNotificationsRead()
    else user dismisses one
        User->>Bell: dismiss (X)
        Bell->>AppData: dismissNotification(key)
    end

    Note over Lib,Bell: Entirely derived client-side from local planner events —<br/>nothing is delivered, scheduled, or pushed anywhere (no push/email/SMS).<br/>Google Calendar occurrences participate the same way as any other<br/>occurrence in this derivation.
